      "source": "Reusable context for binding parameters to a placeholder or a SpEL expression within a JSON structure. <br/>\nTo be used along with <a href=\"ParameterBindingDocumentCodec.html#decode(java.lang.String,org.springframework.data.mongodb.util.json.ParameterBindingContext)\"><code>ParameterBindingDocumentCodec.decode(String, ParameterBindingContext)</code></a>.",
